{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >What if you could bring your favorite FPS/TPS button layouts onto the basketball court?<br>\u201cTPBC\u201d is a one-of-a-kind third-person basketball game that fuses the pinpoint aiming and smooth character control of shooters with the intense, fast-paced action of basketball.<br>Pull off spin moves, crossovers, and step-backs while locking onto the rim and firing your shot. Rack up points with your refined skills and unique playstyle!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>[Game Features]</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Online multiplayer battles against players worldwide</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Full-court 3v3 matches</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose from 7 unique characters</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Jump shots demand not only accuracy but also shot speed depending on distance</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A wide variety of shooting motions including layups, floaters, and fadeaways</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Context-based passing such as bounce passes, overhand passes, and behind-the-back passes</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bonus mini-game: Three-Point Contest</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3396100?t=1758933662","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3396100?t=1758933662","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3396100/b84ca5750fd6875f3aff9201c394cc4265700bbc/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1758933662","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3396100/b84ca5750fd6875f3aff9201c394cc4265700bbc/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1758933662","categories":[{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"description":"Online PvP","id":36},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"Camera 